      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "UNITED GEORGE (5) was prominent early from the tricky draw and did a fair job to be beaten 7 lengths into third (29.86) at Sandown in a Restricted WIN H over 515m. Form from his last run is proving strong. Key chance in this line up. SAFFRON MONSOON (1) made it two minor placings on the trot when beaten third (30.57) in a Grade 7 at this track last time out. Well placed here and can atone this time. ELORA DASH (2) had been going along well winning a Mix 6/7 three back then placing at this track before missing the frame latest when fourth (30.51) at this track. Well placed here and should do much better. SAINT FISHY (4) form at this course and distance reads well.",
